          "reasons": [
           {
            "@type": "meaningComprehension",
            "comprehends": [
             "copies/ty610zx2946#inscription"
            ],
            "note": "Graded low on the figures of the date: the figures could give another date. Pencil. Region 1 carries only the five-digit group 28622, with no separators and no name. Read as 28.6.22 on the pattern reading.md gives for 14114 = 14.1.1914, but it could as well be a serial or order number rather than a date, since the roll's own number 416 is written separately in region 3 and nothing ties 28622 to a punch date. Region 2 is blank leader, region 4 carries a pencil caret only."
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       },
       "medium": "pencil"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
